      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's probably not possible for this to be the case 100% of the time, as there always needs to be a master, even before the portal owner joins, but it _would_ be nice if mastership was _transferred_ to the portal owner if they join within a certain time after the portal was opened.",
