      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding on this, I think it would be cool to have an option at instance creation to select 'master behavior' with 2 options like \"me\" or \"default\". \n\"default\" should behave like current one (first joining player is master until they disconect)\n\"me\" would behave same as \"default\" until the instance creator joins the world, that would trigger the transfer of the Master role to them",
